        <mxCell id="c79" value="&lt;i&gt;Profile_Invoices with Column quality and Column distribution on. Outlined: the empty share of PaymentDate, and the number of distinct values of Status (Settled, Partially Settled and Submitted on the entire data set; Settled alone in the first 1,000 rows). The first rows are the earliest invoices, nearly all paid. The preview shows two of the table&#x27;s columns and is the same on both bases, and the distribution is drawn for Status only, although the editor draws it under every column.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="404" width="860" height="68" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
